<title>UK: UK Peugeot workers vote for strike.</title>
<headline>UK Peugeot workers vote for strike.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK workers for French car-maker PSA Peugeot Talbot have voted overwhelmingly in favour of strike action and other types of industrial action, union officials confirmed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The strike ballot of Peugeot's Coventry workers showed 1,720 in favour of striking, with 363 against, said a spokesman for the Transport and General union. In a ballot on other forms of industrial action 1,848 were in favour, with 243 against, said the T&amp;G.</p>
</text>
